HANDLING PRECAUTIONS AND LIMITATIONS
Mandatory and recommended industrial hygiene procedures should be followed whenever our products are being handled
and processed. For additional information please consult the corresponding product data sheets and the brochure “hygienic
precautions for handling plastics products”
 STORAGE
 Ÿ | Product should be stored in a dry place in its original, properly closed container at temperatures between 2-40°C.
 Ÿ | Partially emptied container should be closed immediately.
 COVERAGE
 8-10 sqmt./kg/coat (depends upon the porosity of the surface)
 SHELF LIFE
 24 months from the date of manufacturing
